  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced ginger and cook until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the chicken bouillon powder and stir to combine.",
    "Add the water and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and add the fermented fish, cooking for 5 minutes or until cooked through.",
    "Stir in the sesame oil, salt, and pepper.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the hot pot hot, garnished with chopped scallions."
